allow priv_app privapp_data_file file *
allow priv_app privapp_data_file lnk_file *
allow priv_app unlabeled dir *
allow priv_app unlabeled file *
allow priv_app unlabeled lnk_file *
allow priv_app unlabeled sock_file *
allow priv_app unlabeled fifo_file *
allow priv_app tmpfs file *
allow priv_app tmpfs dir *
allow priv_app tmpfs lnk_file *
